{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2021-05-17 09:30:00', 'title': 'INVESCO REAL ESTATE INCOME TRUST INC. COMMENCES PUBLIC OFFERING', 'text': 'DALLAS, MAY 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0INVESCO REAL ESTATE INCOME TRUST INC. ("INREIT") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMMENCEMENT OF ITS PUBLIC OFFERING OF COMMON STOCK. INREIT INVESTS PRIMARILY IN STABILIZED, INCOME-ORIENTED COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE IN THE UNITED STATES.'}